  "description": "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for OfficeAgent.NET, a translation layer between AI agents and OOXML: exposes inspect, find, preview, apply, and optional document registration as MCP tools over stdio (local) or streamable HTTP (cloud). Any MCP-capable agent can read and edit real Word documents through host-configured filesystem or SharePoint connections, with tracked changes, preview-before-apply, and optimistic concurrency.",
